24
00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,730
Another Soul Transformation ?

25
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,150
Junior Ceng Niu,

26
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:04,010
as I told you,

27
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,550
today

28
00:02:06,150 --> 00:02:07,810
is the day you die.

29
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:29,810
My spiritual energy is in chaos

30
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:31,250
and my Origin Soul is damaged.

31
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:33,350
Even when using the celestial sword

32
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:36,080
I am not as strong as when I fought Red Butterfly.

33
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:40,770
This Heaven-Sealing Formation is extremely complex,

34
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:42,950
it must be some kind of ancient inheritance.

35
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:44,850
I can't escape it in a short time.

36
00:02:51,220 --> 00:02:52,050
Master, run !

37
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:12,850
This truly is a fine sword.

38
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:15,810
It even contains a Sword Spirit !

39
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,400
Good.

40
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,050
This sword can be yours

41
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:26,650
but the flag that can summon tribulations

42
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,520
belongs to me.

43
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,050
Fine,
